35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The audit revealed that hardware-heavy assets require outside appraisals, adding six weeks and fees.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Retention data shows our software tools lost a third of accounts during price hikes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,Our credit line treats subscription contracts as worthless security. We cannot borrow against them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,Recruiters take four months to place field crews. We cannot staff physical operations quickly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,One holding lost five months to a controller shortage. Hardware supply chains are fragile.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, if subscriptions are worthless to lenders, our liquidity is trapped in code.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, the controller shortage confirms that physical hardware is a delivery bottleneck.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, this means we need cash reserves, not just equity, for the next two years.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if we can't keep customers, the exit profile is even worse than I thought.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the field crew delay means we should avoid companies needing seasonal labor.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,I prefer software that doesn't require physical appraisals. It keeps our quarter-end clean.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I am leaning toward the clinic scheduler. It serves independent practices with high retention.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,"I am concerned about the harvest sensor. It has hardware, which means appraisal delays.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,The fabric loop needs sorting facilities and crews. That is a nightmare for us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The ledger bridge is pure software. No hardware, no supply chain risks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
